 ZENITH   1 Session  2 APIs  3 Log  4 History                ·     ·                        ••      ·        ∙  ·                                        ? keys
                                ┌ keys ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
                                │ Everywhere                                                                                   │
                                │   ?                       every key, by where it works                                       │
                                │   Tab                     the next tab                                                       │
                                │   Shift+Tab               the previous tab                                                   │
                                │   F1, Alt+1               Session, where the terminal delivers the key                       │
                                │   F2, Alt+2               APIs, where the terminal delivers the key                          │
                                │   F3, Alt+3               Log, where the terminal delivers the key                           │
                                │   F4, Alt+4               History, where the terminal delivers the key                       │
                                │   /                       a command, on the Session tab                                      │
                                │   Ctrl+O                  the whole envelope of the latest call                              │
                                │   Ctrl+R                  restart SOLAR, and pick up a new build                             │
                                │   Ctrl+L                  draw the whole screen again                                        │
                                │   Ctrl+C                  cancel the call in flight when SOLAR offers solar.cancel; again,   │
                                │                           quit                                                               │
                                │   Esc                     close the overlay, menu or form                                    │
                                │                                                                                              │
                                │ The command line                                                                             │
                                │   Enter                   run the line as typed                                              │
                                │   Tab                     complete, and the next candidate                                   │
                                │   Shift+Tab               the previous candidate                                             │
                                │   Tab                     on an empty line, the next tab                                     │
                                │   Shift+Tab               on an empty line, the previous tab                                 │
                                │   ↑                       the menu when it is open, the history otherwise                    │
                                │   ↓                       the menu when it is open, the history otherwise                    │
                                │   ←                       move left                                                          │
                                │   →                       move right                                                         │
                                │   Home, Ctrl+A            the start of the line                                              │
                                │   End, Ctrl+E             the end of the line                                                │
                                │   Ctrl+←, Alt+B           a word left                                                        │
                                │   Ctrl+→, Alt+F           a word right                                                       │
                                │   Backspace               delete back                                                        │
                                │   Delete                  delete forward                                                     │
                                │   Ctrl+W                  delete the word before                                             │
                                │   Ctrl+U                  delete to the start                                                │
                                │   Ctrl+K                  delete to the end                                                  │
                                │   PgUp, Ctrl+B            scroll the transcript up                                           │
                                │   PgDn, Ctrl+F            scroll the transcript down, and follow it at the bottom            │
                                │   ?                       on an empty line, this help                                        │
                                │                                                                                              │
                                │ Lists                                                                                        │
                                │   ↑, k                    up one                                                             │
                                │   ↓, j                    down one                                                           │
                                │   PgUp, Ctrl+B            up a page                                                          │
